      "issues": [
        "- The text states \"5 प्रमाणित पैटर्न प्रकार\" but the SHAPES mnemonic lists 6 pattern types (Shading/Shifting, Half-turn/Rotation, Addition/Alternate, Position change, Element count, Symmetry/Size change) → Change the initial claim to \"6 प्रमाणित पैटर्न प्रकार\" or reduce the mnemonic to 5 types.",
        "- The claim \"तुम्हारा दिमाग़ नई जानकारी का 50% 24 घंटों के अंदर भूल जाता है\" is inaccurate; the Ebbinghaus forgetting curve indicates approximately 60-70% loss within 24 hours without repetition → Correct the percentage to \"60-70%\" or replace with a vague phrase like \"अधिकांश भाग\"."
      ],
